00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:41.920
Versuchen Sie,

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:42.760
ruft alle Aufgaben

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:44.180
aus dem angegebenen Planner-Plan ab,

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:45.360
damit der Agent Sie in Antworten

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:46.580
